    "description": {
      "value": "<p>This supple, barbed tentacle bonds with your wrist and forearm, feeding through microscopic capillaries. It functions as a <em>+1 striking whip</em> that deals 1d6 slashing damage, has the agile and finesse traits, and extends your reach to 10 feet. When you critically hit a creature with the tentacle whip, the barbed sting injects psychoactive venom: the target must succeed at a DC 24 Fortitude save or become stupefied 1 for 1 minute (stupefied 2 on a critical failure).</p>"
